{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415761","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415761","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041576101:1":{"text":"失礼を承知で尋ねるが、君の中にも、生死に対する執着があるのだろうか？","source_cn":"恕我失礼，阁下，你的内心中是否也有着关于生死的执念？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x415B1F4334AE31BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576102:1":{"text":"なぜそんなことを聞く？","source_cn":"为何这么问？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89507CC947B0CD41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576103:1":{"text":"見えたからだ……君の眼差しに宿る僕と同じ――いや、かつての僕と同じ執着をな。","source_cn":"我能看出来……你的眼神中有着与我相似的执着。或者说，与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62115F5D2F9A961D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576104:0":{"text":"僕はずっと果てなき不死の中で真の解放を求めていた――つい最近、思いがけず「生きる」理由を見つけるまでは……","source_cn":"我曾对自己的“生命”不屑一顾，在漫长的永生中寻找着真正...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8D1981E59524035","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576105:1":{"text":"……そうか。","source_cn":"……这样啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B1456F7866F4F31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576106:0":{"text":"だが、私と君は違う。","source_cn":"不，我们不一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFF1BFFB9ED0D697","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576107:1":{"text":"君は己の「死」に執着していたのだろう。だが私が探し求めているのは、冷たい海の中で唯一、温もりを感じられる命だ。","source_cn":"你执着于自己的“死”，而我在试着寻回那冰冷的海水中，唯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95D14BDE2F20A8CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576108:1":{"text":"なるほど。君の執着は他者に起因しているのだな。","source_cn":"如此看来，你的执念是关于他人的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x440F0D6B376E1FFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576109:1":{"text":"私の妻だ。彼女との別れはあくまでも一時的なもの。私は……必ず彼女を生き返らせる。","source_cn":"我的妻子。但她的离去是暂时的，而我……一定会将她复活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79E4B60EAE2DBC1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576110:1":{"text":"奥方を、グレイヴボーンにするつもりなのか？","source_cn":"你想让她也成为亡灵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98C692F6DE1E5C7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576111:1":{"text":"グレイヴボーン？まさか……あんなに素晴らしい女性が、長い時の中で抜け殻と化すなど、あってはならない。私は「生きた」彼女を取り戻すのだ。","source_cn":"亡灵……不，她如此美好，不该在漫长的时间中变得浑浑噩噩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D3294D162B59691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041576112:1":{"text":"妻がグレイヴボーンとなって蘇った前例はある。だが、死者が真の意味で生き返ることはない。それは何ものにも逆らえない世の理だ。","source_cn":"阁下，让你的妻子复活为亡灵尚有先例，但死者不会再以鲜活...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B9725195B3E7D11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041576113:1":{"text":"「死者が生前の姿のまま蘇る」ことも、なかったわけではないが……あれはただの悲劇でしかなかった。","source_cn":"“死者复活为生前的样子”……我曾见过这样一幕，相信我，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x393672B11221E1B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041576114:1":{"text":"陸の者には、海が我々に授けた命の神秘など理解できないだろうな。","source_cn":"大海给予我们的生命奥秘，你们陆上之人永远不会明白。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0372EBD6A57AB450","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041576115:1":{"text":"たとえ千年、いや一万年かかろうとも……私は必ず彼女を取り戻してみせる。","source_cn":"我一定能带回她，哪怕花费一千年、一万年……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD62AE57AB4442792","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:柳博米尔":{"text":"リュボミル","source":"柳博